"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/micromatch \"Glob matching "
"for javascript/node.js. A drop-in replacement and faster alternative to "
"minimatch and multimatch.\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/expand-brackets_README.md:255
