" complete Bash… [more](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/nanomatch) | "
"[homepage](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/nanomatch \"Fast, minimal "
"glob matcher for node.js. Similar to micromatch, minimatch and "
"multimatch, but complete Bash 4.3 wildcard support only (no support for "
